    "60×56% reserves idle silhouette at both facings; attack10 and corpse15 can extend beyond that idle reservation.",
    "The current allocator prioritizes exact printed spawn/lamp feet. That branch bypasses body overflow/overlap selection, so oversized bosses can extend beyond a tile without crowded=true.",
